sequenceDiagram
    participant C as UI or tool caller
    participant G as App gateway
    participant W as SQLite write owner
    participant S as Supervisor
    C->>G: Continue with key K and exact holds
    G->>G: Bind host authority and validate message
    G->>W: Look up scoped K then current revisions
    W->>W: Commit control, decision, receipt and wakeup
    W--xC: Commit response lost
    W-->>S: Best effort wakeup hint
    Note over S,W: Dispatch still checks current authority and blockers
    C->>G: Retry exact K and normalized command
    G->>W: Current visibility and receipt lookup
    W-->>C: Recorded old decision, replayed true
    Note over C,W: Receipt replay does not dispatch again
    C->>G: New Pause with key P
    G->>W: Renew pause latch and control revision
    W-->>C: Pause accepted, stopping status separate
    C->>G: Retry old Continue K
    G->>W: Return original receipt under current visibility
    W-->>C: Historical decision, newer pause remains
    C->>G: New Continue with current control and stale hold
    G->>W: Check current control and covered holds
    W-->>C: Revision conflict, no holds cleared
